<title>NETHERLANDS: KONDOR SEES SIGNIFICANT PROFIT GROWTH.</title>
<headline>KONDOR SEES SIGNIFICANT PROFIT GROWTH.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch construction firm Kondor Wessels said on Friday it expected significant profit growth in the full year 1996/97.</p>
<p>Earlier, Kondor Wessels reported a higher first half net profit of 15.4 million guilders compared with 13 million in 1995/96.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, construction firm Volker Stevin unveiled plans to merge with Kondor to create a new company Volker Wessels Stevin NV.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
